    "show_share": true,
    "description": "\"The ground-breaking ceremony for the Aga Khan University's Matiari Research and Training Centre took place today. The construction of the state-of-the-art one-storey building will enable the University to expand its research on mother and child issues in support of national health policy and to strengthen the capacity of local, on-the-ground health care practitioners.",
